    heading: 'iPhone Carrier Unlock Software: Can an App or Jailbreak Work?',
    description: 'Learn what Apple’s official guidance says about carrier unlocks, jailbreak risks and erase-and-restore steps for iPhone users.',
    standfirst: 'Apple’s official guidance assigns carrier-unlock authorization to the carrier, not to a downloadable app or local reset.',
